Z||000002||Nashco||10-28-2001||01:47 AM||||Yes, I'd love to hear something on this too.  I've heard stories of people who could drive under roadblocks, semi trucks, fence posts, etc...but no pics.<P>HOW ABOUT A PICTURE CONTEST???  Who can find the coolest thing to drive under?  No photoshop pictures allowed either <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I think this would be an awesome "scavenger hunt" kind of photo...we can all keep an eye out and take photos of our car underneath all different kinds of things.<P>My ultimate goal is to be able to drive under a semi (not inspired by, but seen in Fast & Furious).  I think with a chop top and massive lowering, it's possible.  Hmm...I wonder if Archie would do MORE than the standard chop top <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Just think, about four inches of lowering, and a four inch chop top!?!<P>So, who's in for a PHOTO CONTEST? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
