Z||000026||Tigger||10-28-2001||09:51 PM||||My Fiero won't fit under most semi's.  I have driven past a couple where I could go under but it's just WAY to risky.<P>The antenna would scrape and with my luck the air lines for the brakes on the truck would probably tangle with the rear spoiler.<P>I know most people that see me on the highway next to one have to thinking "holy cow!"  It's pretty incredible to look over see the underside of the trailers and your reflection in the chrome wheel centers.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue4.gif">     <BR>T-T-F-N, Ta Ta For Now!<BR><A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/tatooine/spielberg/241/" TARGET=_blank>Tigger's Fiero Page</A><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-28-2001).]||||reg||6
